  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Law and Order Trust Fund (LOTFA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Law and Order Trust Fund for Afghanistan is a multi partner trust fund covering the entire rule of lew chain. This grant is earmarked for the Support to Payroll Management Project (SPM). SPM is a financing mechanism for paying out salaries to the Afghan police and prison personnel. SPM is responsible for the systems and procedures related to payroll management and has a component for building capacity in Ministry of Internal Affairs (MOIA) related to payroll management, institutional reform and professionalization of the police.</narrative>
  </description>
